MCP keeps proving to be the right interface for agent tools.

@canva just made its MCP generally available. Agents can now generate editable designs and videos, remove backgrounds, resize creative, and export the final file.

Everything comes back as an editable Canva design that you can review and tweak.

Agents are the next big distribution channel for products, services, and software.

But how do they decide what to recommend? 

@omooretweets and I did a deep dive with @promptingco - and we're sharing takeaways after running 11k+ agent tests 👇 https://x.com/i/article/2124958492356419584

